---
import ChoosePage from "../components/ChoosePage.astro";
---

<ChoosePage
  title="Which component?"
  description="Every component a person picks on its own, with the first reason its contract gives to use it."
>
  <p class="lede">
    Find the row that describes what the person in front of the screen needs, then open its page: the rest of its reasons,
    when to avoid it and what to use instead are there. When nothing fits a shape, compose it from the layout primitives
    (Stack, Inline, Grid, Box) rather than giving an element a widget's role. Agents read the same table, as
    <code>choose.md</code> inside <code>@skryensya/core</code>.
  </p>
</ChoosePage>
